{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_title", "source_sha256": "f58550670f8f792df87caf8f6b04d6d38c4d7785da93397221bb91ea5920fa4e", "ja": "拝啓、いつかの君に", "zh": "敬启，致未来的你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_synopsis", "source_sha256": "967f13291454d38dfe2ccc6305af620cfffdc10181058ad5dde931a07ca1c2b8", "ja": "ひなたの元に届いた、一通のファンレター。\n返事に悩んでいるうちに、公演のセンターも\n任される事に。メンバー達と話し、自分らし\nい言葉を返せばいいと気づいたひなたは、気\n合いも十分、ステージに臨むのだった。", "zh": "日向收到了一封粉丝来信。\n就在她还在为如何回信而烦恼时，\n又被委以了公演C位的重任。在与伙伴们\n畅谈后，日向意识到只要用属于自己的\n话语去回应就好。干劲十足的她，\n毅然登上了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e7c1fe081aff5f30934f1cd36099fca67a995322f0e2ae7ee857685543523849", "ja": "（センター公演に向けて、ひなた達のレッスンが\n始まっている。ちょっと様子を見に行ってみようか）", "zh": "为了中心公演，日向她们已经开始训练了。去稍微看看情况吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "f369bf57c68216280cef967258b5c2e21bfd0ecd1d4377bc4ea3c0cf0b0b54a5", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！\nはぁ、はぁ……響さん、こんな感じでどうだろか？", "zh": "一、二、三、四！\n哈啊，哈啊……响姐，这样感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "4bade04a046bbb17e779d4e90bf0a2536ccf41e5e4559b7cb63ab78b8ff17b1f", "ja": "ひなた……すごいぞーっ！？\n自分のダンスに、もう合わせてくるなんて！", "zh": "日向……好厉害啊——！？\n这么快就能配合我的舞蹈了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "c3e4072b97efbe408a9f5c7227781b9de56c5c1fb0d70b56c58e394f9b85d463", "ja": "でも、ところどころ間違ってしまったべさ。\n響さんこそ、やっぱりすごいねぇ。", "zh": "不过，有些地方还是跳错了。\n响才厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "d5f5e883b29ac679aa1610a427e1868b1690b4fcfcb0b9a2d8e315bbd5f799aa", "ja": "いやいや、全然ついてこれてたってば！\n間違いって言っても、ほんのちょっとだったし。", "zh": "不不，你完全跟得上啦！\n就算说是失误，也只是一点点而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "21c8a0a4958a2ca0463ec420ab1e1b158116fb378d34157fbab596104cd47e5c", "ja": "でも、響さんはカンペキだったでしょや？\nあたしもまだまだ、がんばらねば。", "zh": "不过，响姐不是表现得完美无缺嘛？我也得继续努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3d401a5f218757a77520eec1c5d276701c7dd713fae97ae37eccca96a0618b72", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま。\nそろそろ一旦、休憩にしたらどうだ？", "zh": "你们两个都辛苦了。\n差不多该先休息一下了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "61b3010376fc158853e6e7cbfcbcf3ab6c81d07bf7583b5f4543258717ffec95", "ja": "{$P$}。\nあたし、もう少しだけレッスンしたいなぁ。いいかい？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我还想再练习一会儿，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "5eb564d13f6135341b577e61ecd39c18e3c32d8408339f6f066104ba51a46196", "ja": "あははっ。ひなた、すごいやる気だね！\nなら自分もとことん付き合うぞ。", "zh": "啊哈哈。日向，干劲十足呢！\n那我也奉陪到底啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "98a735f732a8dd4734946d37f155e1c89220244f6a3e9968729e94d31d00c91e", "ja": "らららら～、らら～ららら～♪", "zh": "啦啦啦啦～，啦啦～啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "57ab3cb0bd425d9901b0a202764ee93f1e24189c155dff5ef7509cf30971bad8", "ja": "まあ……！　ひなたさん、綺麗な声です。\n高音の伸びが、とてもよくなっているような……？", "zh": "哎呀……！日向小姐，声音真好听。\n高音的延展度，感觉变得非常好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "4ab26430ca54ad712579f938032a668e94b29874edbdd5c0f48c9021d26a8341", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、前よりものびのび歌ってますね～。\n私も負けずに、のびのびしますよ～。", "zh": "日向唱得比以前更悠然自得了呢～。\n我也不会认输，要放轻松悠着来哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "05417deb979fe8747b8e0e10196622d72278bd1142f2aea4617444676b5926a9", "ja": "ふふふ。のびのびすることで美也さんにかなう人は、\nそういなさそうだねぇ。", "zh": "呵呵呵。要说舒展自在，恐怕没人能比得上美也姐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "e17c883eeb05e80bdecef5692d9364eae61102ff98d5c9880b1f70a571b99342", "ja": "{$P$}。\nひなたちゃん、変わりましたね！", "zh": "{$P$}。\n日向，你变了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1014_p", "source_sha256": "22f62007d93faa8ef1ddef77ca1b7ed9309f8ea4c62ba67c3116e023c9decd3c", "ja": "紗代子、お疲れさま。やっぱりそう思うか？", "zh": "纱代子，辛苦了。果然你也这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "b089b49e7d8862e616b5579fe89c895d2a06ada82c24cc06ed75498888118e9a", "ja": "はい！　歌もダンスもすごくしっかりしてて。\nなにより……意欲？　情熱……ううん。", "zh": "是的！无论是歌唱还是舞蹈，都非常扎实。\n最重要的是……干劲？热情……不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "325eaea0c47bb7e6b7c8b1add669e4362251bea74f2c820ac179aa62dfce7e0f", "ja": "アイドルとしての姿勢、っていうのかな？\n取り組み方が変わった気がして。", "zh": "该说是作为偶像的态度吗？\n感觉你对待工作的方式变了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1017_p", "source_sha256": "390180074b1f65aecddeed7883eb7defeb7698ab3f710d99bf6043e04c9e7659", "ja": "そうだな……変わったって言うなら、\nちょっと自信がついてきたのかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊……要说有变化的话，\n可能是稍微有了点自信吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "8e4eea90de7ffbd4cae86c73820fd83c97c38126412bf1c7466d7372489969db", "ja": "ですね！　ひなたちゃんってもともと努力家ですし、\nそういう事で変わるのかも。", "zh": "是啊！日向本来就是个很努力的人，说不定正是因为这些事情才发生了变化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "89321beb9b68963e3e5dee6da7cf2bf37cd22238506e88069d0af9d8b5176f7c", "ja": "こんなガツンと気合いが入ったひなたちゃんと\n一緒にステージに立てるの、嬉しいです。", "zh": "能和这样干劲十足的日向一起站上舞台，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "ebdd7df375c7ac1d4f8b9316209a37e2ae7a6e1989c3dc28ec2fa8daa20200b9", "ja": "……私も負けていられないな。ふふっ。", "zh": "……我也不能输呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1021_p", "source_sha256": "460c7832be429e2855a11afe067a88b7689cc8f85773ff17e1aea27ad4a55805", "ja": "（ひなたのやる気が、メンバーに影響を\n与えているみたいだ。これはいい傾向だな！）", "zh": "（日向的干劲似乎影响了成员们。\n这是个好现象啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1023_p", "source_sha256": "549f21fc15c22998bb9e5edb822ac7d8d932d1b715a16b5d20e68be04cee32a3", "ja": "（ふぅ……今日の仕事はこんなもんか。\nそろそろ上がるかな）", "zh": "（呼……今天的工作就到这里吧。差不多该下班了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "a19ab90eec211d10eaf39b3cdc0b9804a255c926f41e05cd43b25682b72023a2", "ja": "{$P$}。\nあの……ちょっこし、いいだろか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n那个……能占用你一点时间不？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1025_p", "source_sha256": "374169261bba851e6f996e49baed1aba66c44c8240b5e568b075a1406e4effea", "ja": "おっと。ひなた、まだ帰ってなかったんだな。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "哎呀。日向，你还没回去啊。\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "4f60892c33a9a99d83cfa398bd0519266a5f7df667a60806e42489e762c691c0", "ja": "あのね、あたし……{$P$}に\n相談したいことがあるんだわ。", "zh": "那个……我……有件事想和{$P$}先生商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2e5096fd35f63f6c9350fb90d2b9011babfef5d8f45be9aa7ece5d5acb0fe08d", "ja": "ああ。なんでも相談してくれていいぞ！\nセンター公演に関することか？", "zh": "啊，没问题，有什么事都可以来找我商量！\n是和Center公演有关的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "7ca0df9e95083ee1b9364b55616554d7dca63ff804aad3164d589f7305cb0714", "ja": "ううん、そうじゃないんだけど……この前あたし、\nファンレターに返事がしたいって言ったでしょや？", "zh": "不是的，倒不是那件事……之前我不是说过，\n想给粉丝来信写回信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0a38c94a6d3112b8841c6dd05faa6d97bae45e87779cb6244db4d5c6431560a9", "ja": "そういえば、そうだったな。\nブログはまだ更新してないみたいだけど。", "zh": "这么说来，确实是这样啊。博客好像还没更新。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "a6d7c80e844dfb880d9c29cc24e42223f593a05daae5558c622bb3cc929b9552", "ja": "うん。なんて書けばいいのか、悩んでしまって。\nあの子、アイドルになりたいらしいんだけども……。", "zh": "嗯。我一直在烦恼该写些什么才好。\n那孩子好像想成为偶像，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "b7bfbe4bc094fa92bf6be70742123bb5080746fbbc95c1a37fc1106912105ece", "ja": "「頑張って」とか「きっとなれるよ」とか……。\n何度書いても、なんだか違う気がするんだわ。", "zh": "比如“加油”或者“一定能成功的”……\n不管写多少次，总觉得哪里不太对劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "bf60b2bcc23d2f18a1ab2c53b40f55f44ce296b0b089848448ab3a43fdb2c27e", "ja": "あたしは、あの子の事情もなんも知らないし。\n手紙に書いてあることしか、わかんないから。", "zh": "我又不了解那孩子的情况。毕竟，我只知道信上写的那些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "a57faa12d94c69f8f23bc81e72a259295344715b2c87c89b1fb0f0327cddd478", "ja": "それなのに、聞こえがいいことばっかり言うのは、\nなんだか無責任な気がしてしまって。", "zh": "可即便如此，只说些好听的话，总觉得有点不负责任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1034_p", "source_sha256": "a7ead1830c2475f64b4a1b76508fe292cf820dab37ea75a87238b3855478dba6", "ja": "まあ、なんとなくわかるよ。\nそこまで重く考えなくてもいいとは思うけど。", "zh": "我也大概能理解。\n虽然我觉得不必想得那么沉重就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1035_035hin", "source_sha256": "d7fc5c5a3ecbb7d71a63ad437d552a26bb3cc42769b6c92ce31cfdca15070cc1", "ja": "うーん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1036_p", "source_sha256": "08aa7e1ffadbc5938ce25622966e0c3bb61f69c10586c1e266cb81182604e5d5", "ja": "気になるなら、公演のメンバーに聞いてみたらどうだ？\n同じアイドルなら、わかる事もあるかもしれない。", "zh": "如果你很在意，要不要去问问演出的成员？\n都是偶像，说不定会有她们了解的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "8eb2b4cd7c1791df15893ddef87e1a65d2f2225df2a6cd96f9ea72dc8e5d0b73", "ja": "あっ、そうだねぇ、そうしてみるべさ！\nありがとさんです、{$P$}。", "zh": "啊，对哦，那就试试看吧！\n谢谢你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1038_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "4fafcf12fc1b21e40e791ca2e853a599930eab3aefdbd6abf4e2b86fef0fc529", "ja": "アイドルになりたい子への\nファンレターの返信、ですか～。", "zh": "是要回复给想成为偶像的孩子的粉丝来信吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1040_035hin", "source_sha256": "c2cc9e96b44d7aaa35962395e2852bcd64a73db89a6e8dcb140408deadc3ce26", "ja": "うん。どう返信すればいいのか困ってしまって。\nなんて返すのがいいんだろうねぇ？", "zh": "嗯。我正愁着不知道该怎么回信呢。\n该怎么回复才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "1de3b427a0383aa201a7756f26791859de02c4537b9ee6bbfe4f42c9197b5e22", "ja": "む～ん、そうですな～……。\n私なら、アイドルになるコツを教えてあげますね～。", "zh": "嗯～，这样呀～……。\n要是我的话，就会告诉她成为偶像的诀窍呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1042_035hin", "source_sha256": "a6ed11106dda8ea13a2bb8baefe0118813fc0838eb3051e83375b2b7bb405eb1", "ja": "コツ……かい？\nそれって、どんなもんだろか。", "zh": "诀窍……吗？\n那会是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "5c13d81efe34449d0811fbf0d0a0bc078a2a1f20be389caca758e3e0f29f6682", "ja": "私、オーディションを受ける前は、\n毎晩寝る前に豆乳を飲んでいましたよ～。", "zh": "我在参加试镜之前啊，\n每天晚上睡觉前都会喝豆浆哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1044_p", "source_sha256": "0a52a52ecfb73f8f17a7141ba82f51b27873e87e1d1a381604518b3c69cb529a", "ja": "そんな事してたのか……体によさそうだな。", "zh": "原来你还做过这种事啊……感觉对身体挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1045_013hib", "source_sha256": "c6d37a9ec161fc22e56b61f6bdf8694f3d12bdcef6d24f3c8f64f83dcde9fa0c", "ja": "それ、アイドルになるコツとはちょっと\n違うんじゃない？　健康にはなりそうだけど……。", "zh": "那个，和成为偶像的诀窍好像有点不一样吧？不过看起来倒是有益健康……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "3c036d721a6f8b3801084669b635d02aecad7122af89c6d2b982801c3b1b3f12", "ja": "そうですかー？　でも私がアイドルになれたので、\n効果はあると思いますよ～、えへんっ。", "zh": "是这样吗？不过我确实成为偶像了，所以我觉得还是有效果的哦～哼哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "3de135f3c7c89be1fdc9d24cfcb691a69368973651e828d7b226d87df41172c9", "ja": "美也さんが仰ると、\nなんだか本当にそう思えてきますね。ふふっ。", "zh": "美也小姐这么一说，我好像真的开始这么觉得了呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "6c5e287695b9d654515b1c1215d0c94d6939752eee0e56376547e658aba1a9dd", "ja": "紗代子ちゃんなら、なんて返信しますか～？", "zh": "纱代子的话，会怎么回复呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1049_027say", "source_sha256": "1c8d9b511ed71d04d6d61149085809cfa7ada1209142c3ba58dec227e94a8fd4", "ja": "私は……そうだなぁ。もし私がファンだったら……。\n普通だけど励ましてほしいかも。", "zh": "我……这个嘛。要是我是粉丝的话……可能会想得到一些普通的鼓励吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1050_027say", "source_sha256": "bee91f3adf76e4d8b50e51ab6aff4ce598f60278ca874cde2c4c709732b83c4c", "ja": "憧れの人からもらった励ましの言葉なら、\nその子にとって、宝物になるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "如果是憧憬之人送上的鼓励话语，对那孩子来说，应该会成为珍宝吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1051_027say", "source_sha256": "5da0ef7bbab3502e0a9c2f378657548398bbf912b2bdd451936db30f47045322", "ja": "ありきたりな言葉だって、\nつらいときに心の支えになったりするものだよ。", "zh": "哪怕是平凡普通的话语，\n在难过痛苦的时候，也会成为心灵的支柱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1052_035hin", "source_sha256": "a9843bc68b582cb309051b7a92e345f790c484571b76ff16a13debdca2d8c208", "ja": "うーん？　そうなんかなぁ……。", "zh": "嗯——？是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1053_032emi", "source_sha256": "4eebbb6b86c8ba97a11ead43dfac4402e64518c00ef92563aa2a93256fea8c54", "ja": "大げさなものでなくても、\n普通のお話ができるだけでも、私は楽しいと思います。", "zh": "就算不是什么轰轰烈烈的大事，\n只要能普普通通地聊聊天，我觉得就很开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1054_032emi", "source_sha256": "03d7d81999e30e296b6a1d7a067cdb424db5edd327d86c4af1933e9d55c23d5d", "ja": "天気のお話とか、好きなもののお話とか……。\n日々の何気ないことでも。", "zh": "聊聊天气，聊聊喜欢的东西之类的……\n哪怕只是每天微不足道的琐事也好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1055_p", "source_sha256": "49c889184b83e687444b5d762fcca331ad44d59a108ae1090ed0b272981eecfe", "ja": "そうだな、気楽に書いていいと思う。\nちなみに響なら、どんな事を書くんだ？", "zh": "嗯，我觉得随意一点写就好。对了，要是响的话，你会写些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1056_013hib", "source_sha256": "371d01db63613fc5c8043265caa3b86789d7e98edae7fe8255c6bb2edeafb600", "ja": "自分は、がんばってね！って書くぞ。\nアイドルになって、自分と勝負だ！　って。", "zh": "我会写“加油哦！”。\n成为偶像，和自己一决胜负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1057_042miy", "source_sha256": "81edd0d2775d9df2d81130621d69a9d21e87ea7ac648f415bee376912b8e46e7", "ja": "おー、響さんらしいですな～。\nそれは、やる気が出るかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "哦——很有响的风格呢～  \n这样一来，说不定会干劲十足呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1058_032emi", "source_sha256": "9d20995cb1d0a627c0ada7baa67cb8d2cc2ee06bad3581208d925e4c40bd1dcc", "ja": "果たし状ですね！\nそういう約束は、励みになりそうです。", "zh": "这是挑战书呢！  \n这样的约定，感觉会成为动力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1059_027say", "source_sha256": "7be23eace554245055f8c4c1a303943714db03ebf2f34c688fc4cb9e042a09e6", "ja": "はっぱをかける感じだね。\n果たし状とは違う気もするけど……。", "zh": "感觉像是在给人打气呢。\n不过，我觉得和挑战书还是不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1060_035hin", "source_sha256": "e9d73c0e7f28b81d3a2da087586e516606897c7d528f2ccea650cd2a9f56452b", "ja": "でも、それだと驚かれてしまわないかねぇ？", "zh": "不过，那样的话不会把人吓一跳吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1061_013hib", "source_sha256": "e064861aa8884ee12654819b2ffca62b5b8c91bb1e8036e43584822aafd68230", "ja": "結局、その子がアイドルになれるかどうかは、\nその子次第だと思うんだ。", "zh": "说到底，那孩子能不能成为偶像，我觉得还是取决于她自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1062_013hib", "source_sha256": "5424838eea6cc52738c79e7bd9def6f7d6429c1882c2acdeca7561ee4f3e0b20", "ja": "アイドルに憧れて、自分もなりたくなって。\nそんな気持ちが、どんどん強くなって……うぎゃーっ！", "zh": "憧れ偶像，自己也想成为偶像。\n这种心情越来越强烈……呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1063_013hib", "source_sha256": "53f008ec3d6fc4e5888d0f4feeaef91567b688efe979046d3cd6978913e7e938", "ja": "……ってなって。東京に出てきちゃう\nくらいじゃないとね！　そうでしょ？　ひなた。", "zh": "……然后就变成这样。得怀着想成为偶像的强烈愿望，跑到东京来才行！对吧？小日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1064_035hin", "source_sha256": "90564ee683bac1b4604289912c8df9078412c1f92928574540e06dbab73c96ae", "ja": "あ……。\nうん、そうかもねぇ。あたしも……ううん。", "zh": "啊……  \n嗯，可能是这样吧。我也……不，没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1065_035hin", "source_sha256": "b6583039c529cd31beb8bfac44cb55a951d117b0bd8282d645c3949a2ca4f460", "ja": "あたしは、{$P$}が見つけて\nくれなかったら東京に来なかったと思うわ。", "zh": "要不是{$P$}找到我，我想我也不会来东京吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1066_p", "source_sha256": "f7597fecce068cc5176b8ab12d3f1c593d1772c9a6156254743ba649655c84bc", "ja": "それはただのきっかけだよ。ひなたにはもともと、\nアイドルに憧れる気持ちがあったんだろう？", "zh": "那只是一个契机而已。小日向原本就有憧憬偶像的心情吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1067_035hin", "source_sha256": "79f0be94bf6d12f321f6fff4aa411252154047e2e93e6f18b65f3ed598319f22", "ja": "うん……あったよぉ。でも、あたしの夢を\nかなえてくれたのは、{$P$}だもの。", "zh": "嗯……是有的呀。不过，实现我梦想的，\n可是{$P$}哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1068_035hin", "source_sha256": "5349d772cc02c9150dc1864d1d35e9700c4837ca9c3ba0c5d5c9e968d7e871cc", "ja": "あの子にも、いい出会いがあったらいいなぁ。", "zh": "要是那个孩子，也能有一场美好的相遇就好了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1069_p", "source_sha256": "ab574d478e031ccdccc0d2821d7bd6df83efc8d52866bf5f074063354054cb96", "ja": "アイドルになりたいっていう強い気持ちは、\nプロデューサーには用意できないものだからな。", "zh": "想成为偶像的强烈愿望，是制作人无法替她准备好的东西啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1070_p", "source_sha256": "b0984673ba22c00fe504d491029451f84293ccc1998ca6bbf0464e688a1a7b50", "ja": "いい出会いって言うなら、その子にとっては、\nひなたとの出会いがそうなんじゃないか？", "zh": "要说美好的相遇，对那个孩子来说，\n和你日向的相遇不就是如此吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1071_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe9965d9634a6fc8a14e429760bfbf0f44705263f0638a8b466a461c6578c600", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな……。\nあたしなんか、全然違うよぉ。", "zh": "诶诶！？怎么会……。\n像我这样的人，完全不是那么回事啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1072_013hib", "source_sha256": "fbd80a1bb5972decf334cd05c24a80a3805354fc3d8d8bdc7de1dbbb000c70d5", "ja": "違わないぞ（です）！", "zh": "才没有不一样（才不是）！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1073_032emi", "source_sha256": "7d23065bbd90ebd78fd908dac6c568f976b82ee78a95646e204e9df19598c231", "ja": "違わないです！", "zh": "没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1074_027say", "source_sha256": "dd3e22e25875fdf57fb4fe580c3e5eb14c6c83ec6638442bdb4e7c36d752c37a", "ja": "違わない！", "zh": "才不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1075_042miy", "source_sha256": "ba8a050148cb8291dd049cdb430de5d0e732dcafe3ca6d62dfcd11a9ccec55e9", "ja": "違わないです～。", "zh": "没错哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1076_035hin", "source_sha256": "1c74405deccdeb0ace6cce47ad357ca005f73755ca52859c637e57f5ceaafac5", "ja": "ひえっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1077_p", "source_sha256": "4441cb8326e4afb55f010fbaafc9ce0ce8f80e74aa332da58f4b103cc251b85e", "ja": "はは、そう思ってるのはひなただけみたいだぞ？\nひなたはもう、立派な劇場のアイドルだよ。", "zh": "哈哈，看来这么想的只有日向一个吧？\n日向，你已经是剧场里出色的偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1078_035hin", "source_sha256": "75fca8ada674e90e77ac206ceb2aed7981b291dd88e41cc187addbfc2370330e", "ja": "う、うん、ありがとうねぇ……えへへ。\nちょっこし照れくさいなぁ。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，谢谢你呀……嘿嘿。\n稍微有点不好意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1079_035hin", "source_sha256": "8109f4b459dca7d2079429d43f421544de8785fea879ec8808a625a8d22bbb1c", "ja": "でも、あたし……うん。あの子にどう返事を\nしたらいいか、わかった気がするよぉ。", "zh": "不过，我……嗯。我好像知道该怎么回复那孩子了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1080_035hin", "source_sha256": "dd104a63c20688a0a82a1ecef6cd66918b771aeac4c578f7ffce2cf977cc08c0", "ja": "あの子は、今のあたしを好きになってくれたんだから。\n背伸びしたり、無理しなくていいんだって。", "zh": "毕竟那个孩子，喜欢的是现在的我呀。\n不用逞强，也不用勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1081_p", "source_sha256": "6cd9bbc4a5a1058c239d7d68cf55fda365bc871b2a2982181a7ec2ac09fac2af", "ja": "そうだな。ひなたらしい言葉を\n返してあげれば、それでいいんだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。只要用符合雏田风格的话回应她，我想这样就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1082_035hin", "source_sha256": "eba07799b0d14f34791fa8cc1909e62b92875c0f3c4059ce26e4f3bd38ec70f1", "ja": "うん。肩に力が入りすぎてたべさ。レッスンして、\nステージに立って……そんな話でいいんだねぇ。", "zh": "嗯。之前是我太紧绷了呢。上完练习课、\n站上舞台……聊聊这些事情就好呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1083_035hin", "source_sha256": "43c1d8b8ae06a830a3641287f0c6203995dedd578f47effb24957ed1348c4bdb", "ja": "したっけまずは、公演を成功させねば！\nレッスンの続き、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "那么首先，得让演出成功才行！接下来的练习，就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1084_null", "source_sha256": "d87e9f16b90b98f4767a8533867e6c4c00d2ff8e4cd1137f3009e6c70f20fb56", "ja": "公演当日……", "zh": "公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1085_p", "source_sha256": "b4c62cf0472b4685256f91d7f16fbb68ed0d64a80a79f4b3b882e303edc77a27", "ja": "よし……そろそろ開演だな。\nみんな、準備はいいか？", "zh": "好……差不多要开演了。\n大家都准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1086_013hib", "source_sha256": "69a9741b0dc0df605eb605ebb3f3c1dd3a68f17b7ce525f9e4abd5872c176375", "ja": "自分はバッチリだぞ！　北のひなたと南の自分で、\n日本列島を制覇しちゃうからね！", "zh": "我已经准备得完美啦！北边的日向和南边的我，\n要把整个日本列岛都拿下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1087_032emi", "source_sha256": "0cbd349acd4ebca8878a823a6cd459a3ffb7ebf1e5e8591c8b3c69af7c019878", "ja": "まあ！　ふふっ……それでしたら、\n私も混ぜてもらえるでしょうか？", "zh": "哎呀！呵呵……要是那样的话，\n也能让我加入吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1088_042miy", "source_sha256": "72647b489bb0d3223b3d9be52cb092c3783870f52c750556bd1e025c854f34b9", "ja": "お～、そうなると、\nイギリスまで制覇ということになりますな～。", "zh": "哦～，这样一来，就算是征服英国了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1089_027say", "source_sha256": "3a3b4bc1a3ac4c1a722221f19b4f71d97856d8851adba44d0b6f047592a61c7e", "ja": "あはは、スケールが大きいね！\nだったらいっそ、世界制覇しちゃおっか。", "zh": "啊哈哈，规模真大呢！\n那干脆就征服全世界吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1090_p", "source_sha256": "3a841cabd9944376a156760a470b80a738f088e30fe9430e4a6876310e6c813c", "ja": "ああ、それくらいの気持ちでいこう！", "zh": "对，就抱着这样的心情上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1091_035hin", "source_sha256": "15d26a5c999864ebdb7105ff8936f441e0fbfa6485286ab5fa7dd32752ef5086", "ja": "えへへ。あたしはただ、来てくれたみんなに、\nあったかい気持ちになってもらいたいべさ。", "zh": "嘿嘿。我只是想让前来的大家，心里都暖洋洋的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_081_1092_035hin", "source_sha256": "63401adfd437fb9e40d320c32d5728c21b14db55768c35ade6dedf1809c96709", "ja": "したっけ、行ってくるから。\n{$P$}、ちゃんと見ててねぇ！", "zh": "那么，我先走了。\n{$P$}，要好好看着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
